OL,3,GNEWSAFatal crash road could see speed
OL,4,Alimit lowered
OL,5,
OL,6,FA busy road where an elderly couple
OL,7,Fdied after being struck by a car could
OL,8,Fhave its speed limit slashed.
OL,10,FSheila Welsh, 81, and her husband
OL,11,FCampbell, 82, were returning home from
OL,12,Fa Christmas carol service when they
OL,13,Fwere involved in a collision on the
OL,14,FA148 at High Kelling, near Sheringham
OL,15,Fin Norfolk, on 22 December 2024.
OL,17,FTheir deaths have led to a campaign for
OL,18,Froad safety improvements along the
OL,19,Fstretch of road.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
