OL,3,GNEWSAFatal crash road could see speed
OL,4,Alimit lowered
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork has already taken place to enlarge
OL,7,Fpavements and add road markings but now
OL,8,Fthere are plans to cut the current
OL,9,Fnational speed limit from 60mph to
OL,10,F50mph.
